<title>USA: Safety-Kleen acquires parts cleaner.</title>
<headline>Safety-Kleen acquires parts cleaner.</headline>
<dateline>ELGIN, Ill. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Safety-Kleen Corp said Tuesday it acquired certain assets of  Pure Solve Inc, a parts cleaner and paint refinishing service company based in Dallas.</p>
<p>The cash transaction was completed in late August and involves operations in the United States as well as in the United Kingdom.</p>
<p>Pure Solve has annual revenue of about $8 million.</p>
<p>In the United States, the acquisition will add about 7,000 customers and 11,000 parts and paint gun cleaning units. About 5,000 units were acquired in England.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
